data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-thinking-layer-867", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "tool_result", "tool_name": "fetch_runbook", "content": null, "status": "success", "result_preview": "<runbook>\n# Pod SandboxCreateFailed / Pod sandbox 创建失败\n\n> Pod异常类型: SandboxCreateFailed | 典型状态: ContainerCreating / FailedCreatePodSandBox | 兼容分类: sandbox_runtime\n\n## 状态识别\n- Events 含 `FailedCreatePodSa", "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788779658787}

