data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-thinking-parallel_evidence-2312", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 关键证据分析\n\n1.  **Pod 当前状态**: `Pending`。\n2.  **核心事件**: Events 中重复出现 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 和 `NoNetworkFound`。\n3.  **错误原文**: `network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found`。\n4.  **Pod 规范**: \n    *   调度到 `node2`。\n    *   容器镜像: `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`。\n    *   注解: `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network`。\n    *   **无** `RuntimeClass` 设置。\n    *   **无** `imagePullSecrets`。\n5.  **Metrics 验证**: `kube_pod_status_phase` Pending=1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788779711630, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "seq": 2313, "ts_ms": 1788779721228, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 46.358, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c734c21c784b4369-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "0bd6853edcbe590df5bf245f1acfc634b7efe09e2fbbc20873cb438bf74846c1", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "eca9ef60b133d18f6466582fe6e45816d273a74097eac7f1191364b366f31569"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "seq": 2314, "ts_ms": 1788779721229, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "seq": 2315, "ts_ms": 1788779730894, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.665, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1827, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 处于 Pending 状态，卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段，无法分配网络。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = `ContainerCreating` (`fact-0fa59b4ae6c4`) | 确认 Pod 处于等待状态，未进入 Running 阶段 |\n| 2 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` value=1, labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating` (`fact-9c77e3b4fd0a`) | 实时指标确认容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待态，佐证状态持久性 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox \"...\": ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (`fact-085db9e5e0fb`) | 直接记录底层 CNI 插件因缺失网络定义导致 Sandbox 创建失败的原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | multus | `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (多次，e.g. `fact-0fe04ab99dac`, `fact-1c1727b4d5f0`) | 从 Multus 侧持续报出特定网络定义 `unavailable-network` 的查找失败错误 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\nKubernetes 的容器状态（事实 1）与 Prometheus 指标（事实 2）共同锁定了故障阶段为网络准备（ContainerCreating）。kubelet（事实 3）与 Multus（事实 4）的日志和事件高度一致，均明确指向同一个缺失对象 `network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)`，证实了 Pod 因缺乏预期的 CNI 配置而无法启动网络沙箱。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 aiops-case-05 中缺少 'unavailable-network' NetworkAttachmentDefinition → Multus CNI 插件查找网络定义失败 → 无法创建 Pod 网络 Sandbox (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 状态卡在 ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置（注解或规范）中请求了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络附加定义，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n这一缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化容器网络时无法找到对应的网络定义，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 始终无法完成网络配置并进入 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见事实 1、3、4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 处于 Pending 状态，卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段，无法分配网络。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = `ContainerCreating` (`fact-0fa59b4ae6c4`) | 确认 Pod 处于等待状态，未进入 Running 阶段 |\n| 2 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` value=1, labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating` (`fact-9c77e3b4fd0a`) | 实时指标确认容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待态，佐证状态持久性 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox \"...\": ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (`fact-085db9e5e0fb`) | 直接记录底层 CNI 插件因缺失网络定义导致 Sandbox 创建失败的原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | multus | `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (多次，e.g. `fact-0fe04ab99dac`, `fact-1c1727b4d5f0`) | 从 Multus 侧持续报出特定网络定义 `unavailable-network` 的查找失败错误 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\nKubernetes 的容器状态（事实 1）与 Prometheus 指标（事实 2）共同锁定了故障阶段为网络准备（ContainerCreating）。kubelet（事实 3）与 Multus（事实 4）的日志和事件高度一致，均明确指向同一个缺失对象 `network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)`，证实了 Pod 因缺乏预期的 CNI 配置而无法启动网络沙箱。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 aiops-case-05 中缺少 'unavailable-network' NetworkAttachmentDefinition → Multus CNI 插件查找网络定义失败 → 无法创建 Pod 网络 Sandbox (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 状态卡在 ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置（注解或规范）中请求了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络附加定义，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n这一缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化容器网络时无法找到对应的网络定义，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 始终无法完成网络配置并进入 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见事实 1、3、4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "c734c21c784b4369-final", "run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "seq": 2317, "ts_ms": 1788779730903, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 处于 Pending 状态，卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段，无法分配网络。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason` = `ContainerCreating` (`fact-0fa59b4ae6c4`) | 确认 Pod 处于等待状态，未进入 Running 阶段 |\n| 2 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` value=1, labels: `container=app`, `reason=ContainerCreating` (`fact-9c77e3b4fd0a`) | 实时指标确认容器处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待态，佐证状态持久性 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: `rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox \"...\": ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (`fact-085db9e5e0fb`) | 直接记录底层 CNI 插件因缺失网络定义导致 Sandbox 创建失败的原因 |\n| 4 | K8s Event | multus | `NoNetworkFound`: `cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05)` (多次，e.g. `fact-0fe04ab99dac`, `fact-1c1727b4d5f0`) | 从 Multus 侧持续报出特定网络定义 `unavailable-network` 的查找失败错误 |\n\n**证据关联分析：**\nKubernetes 的容器状态（事实 1）与 Prometheus 指标（事实 2）共同锁定了故障阶段为网络准备（ContainerCreating）。kubelet（事实 3）与 Multus（事实 4）的日志和事件高度一致，均明确指向同一个缺失对象 `network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network)`，证实了 Pod 因缺乏预期的 CNI 配置而无法启动网络沙箱。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n命名空间 aiops-case-05 中缺少 'unavailable-network' NetworkAttachmentDefinition → Multus CNI 插件查找网络定义失败 → 无法创建 Pod 网络 Sandbox (FailedCreatePodSandBox) → Pod 状态卡在 ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为：Pod 配置（注解或规范）中请求了一个名为 `unavailable-network` 的 Multus 网络附加定义，但该资源在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在。\n\n这一缺失导致 Multus CNI 插件在初始化容器网络时无法找到对应的网络定义，进而引发 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误，使 Pod 始终无法完成网络配置并进入 `ContainerCreating` 状态（见事实 1、3、4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 33.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 46.4s (Evidence 36.8s, RCA 9.3s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 89.651, "metrics": {"run_id": "c734c21c784b4369", "mttr": {"value": "1.5m", "seconds": 89.65775871276855, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 89657.75871276855, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 80535.00938415527, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 12000.721216201782, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 8642.527341842651}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 33612.956047058105, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 46358.49690437317, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9664.606809616089, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

